{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkdqo9SC5CQ7rBRfkW2i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hello, sweetheart. Yes, I looked at that page about the קרן השתלמות from the new job. I'll tell you straight.\n\n**What I decided:** I haven't decided anything yet. I'll ask you, and the new employer's office too. Here's what I understood. You can take the money out without tax 6 years after the first deposit. But the first screen says **\"למי שהגיע לגיל הפרישה מספיקות 3 שנים\"**. I'm 67, so I think for me it's three years. That part I'm fairly sure of. The amount I'm much less sure of. The page has a calculator, and the only number that stayed with me is **66,513 ₪ \"נשאר בידיים\"**. That's for someone who earns 12,000 a month and takes the money out after 5 years. I don't know what my salary will be, so I didn't change the boxes. What decided it for me was that one sentence about three years.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top part, \"מה זה\". It's readable, white letters on black. The employer puts in up to 7.5% and I put in 2.5%. It's tax-free after 6 years, or 3 at retirement age.\n2. The calculator, \"כמה כסף נשאר לכם, ומתי?\". The boxes are clear: salary 12,000, 2.5, 7.5, and something called \"תשואה בשנה 7\". I didn't touch anything.\n3. A big bar chart. My part is 18,000 and the employer's is 54,000. Then there's a red **\"−13,974\"** next to \"המס\". That frightened me, honestly. Only after that does it say \"66,513 נשאר בידיים\". It took me a while to see that the red is tax because I took it out before 6 years. Even then, for someone my age it should be 3 years, and the chart didn't say anything about that.\n4. Underneath, in small grey letters: \"התשואה 7% בשנה... הנחות של האתר, לא תחזית\". So it isn't a promise.\n5. Then came \"S&P500\", \"מדד\" and \"חשבון ניירות ערך\", which aren't for me. I skimmed \"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע\", and saw names like הראל and אלטשולר שחם.\n6. \"משיכה ומעבר\": the money arrives within 4 working days. Then \"כמה זה עולה\": up to 2% a year from the savings, and nothing taken from deposits. That's where I stopped, because I was tired. I didn't get to \"מיסוי\" or \"סיכונים\".\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"S&P 500\", \"מדד\" as they use it here (to me it's the prices on the news), \"מסלול\", \"מסלול כללי\", \"דמי ניהול\" as a percentage of everything saved, \"תשואה 7%\", the little tags like \"KH-19\" and \"PF-18\", and \"חוקים וכללים · 10\". The small grey sentences under the chart were very hard to read. The dark background tired my eyes.\n\n**What I'd change:** Put the 3-years-at-retirement-age rule into the calculator itself. Show the amount in hand in big letters first, before the red minus. Don't open the investment choices with English letters. And use bigger, brighter text for the explanations."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3871,"cache_read_input_tokens":11674,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3871},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4af0d94-c946-44eb-8681-3f4602a346fa","uuid":"32619e23-a4bf-4e08-b086-fcb8fe84174c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:18:47.062Z","request_id":"req_011CgkdqnvYPrQd2oqg3wAnc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkdqo9SC5CQ7rBRfkW2i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KvqSDaMdCsUXXerMYrxeFP","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"answer":"I think that at my age I can take the money out tax-free after 3 years (the page says 6 years, but 3 for people who have reached retirement age). The page's example, with a 12,000 salary over 5 years, gives about 66,500 ₪ in hand, but I didn't enter my own salary, so I'll check with my son and the employer before I rely on it.","confidence":"unsure","gave_up":false,"stuck":[{"where":"screen 3, bar chart","why":"The red minus 13,974 under 'המס' came before the amount in hand and frightened me. It took time to understand it's tax for taking money out before 6 years."},{"where":"screen 3, calculator","why":"The calculator is set to 5 years and counts tax. Screen 1 says that at retirement age 3 years is enough, and I couldn't tell whether the calculator knows that."},{"where":"screen 2, calculator boxes","why":"I don't know my salary at the new job, and I didn't understand 'תשואה בשנה 7', so I left the numbers as they were."}],"used":["Screen 1: 'אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך... בלי מס' and 'למי שהגיע לגיל הפרישה מספיקות 3 שנים'","Screen 1: employer up to 7.5%, employee 2.5%","Screen 3: 18,000 my deposits, +54,000 from the employer, −13,974 tax, 66,513 'נשאר בידיים'","Screen 3: 'הנחות של האתר, לא תחזית'","Screen 5: money arrives 'עד 4 ימי עסקים'","Screen 6: management fees 'עד 2% בשנה', fees on deposits 'לא גובים'"],"skimmed":["Screen 2: the paragraph about moving to another fund","Screen 4: 'שווה לדעת' and the S&P500 example","Screen 5: 'מי מציע ומי מצטרף', names of the companies","Screen 6: transfer to a pension fund"],"skipped":["Screen 2: the investment buttons (S&P 500 מדד, אג\"ח צמודה, מזומן שקלי)","Screen 4: 'חשבון ניירות ערך' link","Screen 5: the 'הצגת החברות' fold","Screens 7–10 (מיסוי, סיכונים ומה מוגן, מונחים), b